# v0.9.1 Phase 8 Task 32 — compile-budget source-bytes limit.
#
# Spec §3.4: max_source_bytes caps incoming source size before parsing.
# Triggers URBI_ERR_COMPILE_BUDGET_SOURCE, surfaced as
# "code":"budget_source" in the dispatcher.
#
# A tight @budget-source=5 override rejects any code longer than 5 bytes.

@budget-source=5

> {"id":14,"op":"eval","code":"1+2+3+4"}
< "id":14 | "kind":"error" | "code":"budget_source"
< "id":14 | "kind":"done"
